  <div class="dp-response"><b>IJDB connection:</b> If this pledge materializes, Qatar will become one of the largest single foreign investors in the United States — giving a Hamas-funding government direct financial stakes in American infrastructure, technology, and real estate at a scale that would make targeted counter-terrorism sanctions nearly impossible without economic self-harm.</div>
